           },
           "required": ["array of strings"],
           "title": "string",
           "type": "object",
           "additionalProperties": false
         },
         "strict": true
       }
     }
     ```
   - Example usage in Python:
     ```python
     bbox_annotation_format=response_format_from_pydantic_model(Image)
