How do I control how long realtime transcription waits before emitting text?

REFERENCE ANSWER
The realtime session takes a target delay setting that trades latency against how much audio the model waits for before emitting.
The dual-delay mode emits a fast provisional transcript and a slower corrected one.

GOLD SOURCES
https://docs.mistral.ai/studio/audio/speech_to_text/realtime_transcription

